WEBVTT

01:32.180 --> 01:33.280
No one is allowed to leave town

01:33.300 --> 01:34.700
Not allowed?

01:35.500 --> 01:37.300
Look behind you

01:45.500 --> 01:49.500
Even if you could fly out of here,
I would shoot you down

01:51.900 --> 01:54.500
No one, not even a fly, can leave!

01:57.500 --> 02:00.500
What a faithful lackey.
What if we force our way out?

02:00.500 --> 02:03.500
-I won't meet force with force
-Scared, are you?

02:04.500 --> 02:07.100
No.
I'll let Adviser Chen deal with you

02:07.100 --> 02:09.100
Adviser Chen?
Where is he?

02:09.500 --> 02:11.500
-Look behind you
-Again?

02:12.500 --> 02:16.500
What's going on? Are you having
some kind of meeting here?

02:17.500 --> 02:20.500
Oh, so you want to leave town, eh?

02:20.500 --> 02:24.980
I'm on a mission. What right
have you to stop me from leaving?

02:25.500 --> 02:27.500
Leave by all means

02:28.500 --> 02:29.980
You mean it?

02:30.500 --> 02:35.500
Yes. But your family
will have to pay for it

02:35.500 --> 02:37.500
What do you mean?

02:37.500 --> 02:41.500
I'm guarding the city gates
by order of the Marquis

02:41.500 --> 02:46.500
You will bring death penalties on
all your relatives if you leave

02:46.980 --> 02:48.980
All my relatives?
Is that really necessary?

02:49.500 --> 02:53.500
His word is the law.
I have no choice

02:53.500 --> 02:58.500
By the time you return,
they'll have been dead and buried

02:59.500 --> 03:01.300
Are you threatening me?

03:01.500 --> 03:07.500
The Marquis believes severe laws are
necessary in these troubled times

03:09.500 --> 03:11.500
What now?

03:11.500 --> 03:13.140
Let's go

03:14.500 --> 03:16.980
So we won't leave town.
Big deal

03:16.980 --> 03:18.500
Take care

03:22.140 --> 03:23.500
Shou!

03:26.500 --> 03:30.500
You haven't left?
This is wonderful!

03:33.500 --> 03:35.980
What's this? Let me go

03:36.500 --> 03:39.500
I know you're happy,
but don't get carried away

03:41.500 --> 03:44.500
Listen, you should believe
what Miss Ma said

03:45.500 --> 03:49.500
She's an honest girl.
She wouldn't lie about such a thing

03:49.980 --> 03:53.500
I didn't say the furnace for
making elixir was a fabrication

03:54.500 --> 03:57.500
What's come over you?
You've changed

03:57.500 --> 03:59.500
What are you talking about?

04:00.500 --> 04:05.500
Like you said, Miss Ma has no reason
to make up such a lie

04:05.500 --> 04:07.980
Not unless she plans to sell you off

04:09.500 --> 04:13.300
Wu Fuqi, why have you
changed your mind overnight?

04:14.500 --> 04:18.500
If you believe me, then come with us
to look for the furnace

04:18.500 --> 04:20.900
No, I can't go with you

04:25.980 --> 04:29.500
Shou, I've got some sesame cakes
for you

04:29.900 --> 04:34.500
I'll be waiting for your good news.
It has to be good news, you hear?

04:37.500 --> 04:41.500
Why are you acting this way?
There's got to be a reason

04:41.500 --> 04:44.500
What is it? Tell me

04:44.500 --> 04:46.500
All right, I'll tell you

04:47.500 --> 04:51.500
Shuangxi and her sister have both
come down with the illness

04:51.500 --> 04:54.500
Surely not?
Both of them?

04:55.900 --> 04:59.500
Miss Ma, their lives are at stake.
I'm counting on you

04:59.500 --> 05:04.500
I really hope you can find a cure
and save all of us from this epidemic

05:06.500 --> 05:08.500
I'll kowtow to you

05:12.500 --> 05:14.500
Get up

05:15.500 --> 05:17.500
Stop acting this way

05:18.980 --> 05:23.500
I give you my word that we will
bring back the furnace

05:24.500 --> 05:27.500
We consider it our duty
to save the people

05:27.500 --> 05:30.500
However,
we are unable to leave town...

05:30.500 --> 05:32.980
without getting Shou's family
into trouble

05:34.500 --> 05:38.980
Don't worry,
I will get both of you out of here

05:39.100 --> 05:42.500
That's easier said than done.
No one can leave

05:42.980 --> 05:44.980
Come up with a plan if you can

05:45.500 --> 05:49.500
Talk is cheap.
It's not as easy as you think

05:56.500 --> 05:58.060
I've got it!

06:00.220 --> 06:01.900
What's with you?

06:01.980 --> 06:05.500
Have you brought me here
to embarrass me again?

06:06.980 --> 06:10.980
No. I know there's a secret tunnel here

06:11.500 --> 06:14.500
Let's forget the whole thing
if you don't believe me!

06:15.500 --> 06:18.500
Will you two knock it off?
We have a mission to accomplish

06:18.500 --> 06:23.500
Fu, can the tunnel really take us out
of town? You'd better not be lying

06:24.500 --> 06:26.500
Why would I lie?

06:26.500 --> 06:29.500
If I can believe there's a furnace
for making elixir in the Eastern Sea,

06:29.500 --> 06:32.500
why can't you believe there's
a secret tunnel in Fengyue Tang?

06:32.500 --> 06:34.500
How did the tunnel come into being?

06:35.500 --> 06:37.500
That's what you don't know

06:37.500 --> 06:40.500
I don't frequent this sort of place,
unlike you

06:41.500 --> 06:43.500
Then let me enlighten you

06:44.100 --> 06:46.980
The tunnel was used
for smuggling people in

06:46.980 --> 06:50.980
Some clients sometimes hid in there
to avoid being caught by their wives

06:51.500 --> 06:53.500
-Is that so?
-It's disgusting

06:54.500 --> 06:59.500
Well, this disgusting tunnel is going
to save the lives of the townsfolk

07:01.500 --> 07:05.500
Take it easy.
Our mission is more important

07:07.500 --> 07:09.300
Help me move this

07:15.500 --> 07:17.500
What! A hole?

07:18.500 --> 07:20.500
Is there a problem?

07:22.500 --> 07:27.300
You expect Ma... I mean the No. 1
constable in the country,

07:27.300 --> 07:29.100
to crawl into this hole?

07:30.500 --> 07:36.500
Fu, this hole is too small for her,
let alone someone my size

07:37.500 --> 07:39.900
Is there a bigger passage?

07:40.500 --> 07:45.500
This is the only tunnel they have.
Take it or leave it

07:45.900 --> 07:47.900
I'm not going in there!

07:51.500 --> 07:55.980
We're on an important mission.
Don't bother about such minor things

07:56.500 --> 08:00.980
The townspeople are counting on us
to save their lives

08:00.980 --> 08:04.500
Do it for their sakes

08:04.980 --> 08:10.500
It's an inconvenience you have to
put up with in order to save lives

08:10.500 --> 08:12.500
Go on

08:13.500 --> 08:17.500
Very well.
I'm only doing this for the townsfolk

08:17.980 --> 08:21.300
Don't you breathe a word about it
to anyone!

08:21.500 --> 08:23.500
My lips are sealed

08:23.500 --> 08:27.500
Same here. We'll deny that
we even saw you today

08:27.500 --> 08:29.100
After you

08:29.900 --> 08:31.500
All right

08:35.500 --> 08:37.500
It's so eerie in there

08:40.500 --> 08:42.500
All right, I'll go in first

08:49.100 --> 08:50.900
Fu, give me a push!

08:53.500 --> 08:55.500
-Are you all right?
-I'm fine!

09:00.500 --> 09:03.500
The floor is filthy.
I can feel it

09:04.500 --> 09:06.500
It's too dark in here

09:08.980 --> 09:10.980
You should have told me
you brought a torch

09:14.500 --> 09:16.140
What's that?!

09:17.500 --> 09:20.500
They're just some human skeletons

09:20.500 --> 09:22.500
How did they get here?

09:24.500 --> 09:27.500
They must be the remains of
some wretched prostitutes

09:27.500 --> 09:29.500
What a tragic way to die

09:30.500 --> 09:34.500
That's men for you. They'll prey on
others to satisfy their own lust

09:53.500 --> 09:55.500
What are you doing?

09:55.980 --> 10:00.500
I'm burying their remains
so they might rest in peace

10:08.500 --> 10:12.500
It's better to be an immortal,
don't you think?

10:13.500 --> 10:17.500
It depends. You'll get punished too
if you're a bad immortal

10:17.500 --> 10:20.500
What if it's your deserved right?

10:20.500 --> 10:22.500
No one is born an immortal

10:22.980 --> 10:24.900
Just answer my question!

10:24.900 --> 10:26.500
Then it's a different matter

10:28.500 --> 10:32.980
How are you, Shuangxi?
Are you feeling better today?

10:35.500 --> 10:40.500
What's wrong? Do you feel giddy
or tight in the chest?

10:40.500 --> 10:42.060
Both

10:44.500 --> 10:48.500
Fuqi, we're seriously ill
as you can see

10:49.500 --> 10:53.100
Don't come again in case
we pass the illness to you

10:53.100 --> 10:57.500
Please don't say that. Who's going
to take care of you if I don't?

11:00.500 --> 11:02.980
We don't want to be a burden to you

11:03.500 --> 11:08.500
It's only right that I take care
of you in your illness

11:08.500 --> 11:11.500
Whether I'll catch the illness or not
is up to Providence

11:11.500 --> 11:13.500
I'm just doing what I have to

11:13.980 --> 11:16.500
Thank you, Fuqi

11:18.980 --> 11:22.980
A friend in need is a friend indeed

11:23.500 --> 11:25.500
Don't say anything more

11:26.100 --> 11:29.500
Get some rest while I decoct
the medicinal herbs for you

12:12.500 --> 12:17.500
O heaven, please watch over them.
Let them get well soon

12:18.980 --> 12:20.500
Tell you what

12:22.500 --> 12:27.500
I'll cast the dice. If the number
is "big", you will have to heal them

12:28.980 --> 12:30.900
Let it be "big"...

12:36.500 --> 12:40.980
"Small"?
Is this some kind of joke?

12:41.500 --> 12:44.500
Let me try again.
Make it "big" this time

12:47.500 --> 12:49.500
"Big"...

12:52.500 --> 12:56.900
"Small" again? You're not playing
a joke on me, are you?

12:57.500 --> 13:00.500
I'll try one last time.
Make it "big"

13:01.500 --> 13:03.500
Fuqi, is the medicine ready?

13:03.500 --> 13:05.060
Coming!

13:06.500 --> 13:09.100
-Do you need my help?
-No, no!

13:09.980 --> 13:11.500
Coming right up!

13:14.500 --> 13:16.060
Here you are

13:16.500 --> 13:18.060
Here's yours

13:18.060 --> 13:21.500
I decocted it for hours.
It's very strong

13:27.500 --> 13:29.140
What's wrong?

13:34.500 --> 13:36.220
What are these?

13:36.500 --> 13:39.500
The people at the medical shop
must have put them in there

13:39.500 --> 13:42.980
How can they do this?
I could have died

13:42.980 --> 13:44.500
This is too much

13:44.900 --> 13:51.500
Fuqi, how could you play with dice
while you were decocting the herbs?

13:51.500 --> 13:53.500
You're incorrigible

13:53.980 --> 13:57.500
Please don't be angry.
I know what I did was wrong

13:59.500 --> 14:04.500
There's nothing my sister and I
hate more than gambling

14:05.500 --> 14:09.500
It was his addiction to gambling
that drove our father to his grave

14:10.500 --> 14:15.980
If you can't give it up,
then please don't come here again

14:18.500 --> 14:23.500
While I'm still breathing
and able to talk,

14:24.500 --> 14:26.500
let me give you some advice -

14:27.500 --> 14:31.500
you must give up gambling
if you want a good life

14:31.500 --> 14:33.140
All right?

14:33.500 --> 14:35.300
Yes, you can count on it

14:35.500 --> 14:37.500
Don't be upset anymore

14:37.500 --> 14:39.100
A likely story!

14:40.980 --> 14:42.500
Fuqi...

14:42.500 --> 14:47.500
A compulsive gambler is like
a person who's caught the plaque -

14:47.500 --> 14:49.500
there is no cure for him

14:49.500 --> 14:51.500
No

14:52.500 --> 14:56.500
Very well, I give you my word.
I won't gamble again

14:59.500 --> 15:01.500
Let's not talk about this anymore

15:01.500 --> 15:06.500
It's your illness I'm concerned about

15:06.980 --> 15:09.500
And I'm concerned about
your compulsive gambling

15:09.500 --> 15:13.500
Promise me you'll give up the habit

15:14.500 --> 15:18.500
Otherwise,
I won't rest in peace when I die

15:20.500 --> 15:22.500
You're not going to die

15:22.500 --> 15:27.500
Don't be angry anymore. I'll go
and have your prescription filled

15:28.500 --> 15:32.500
Get some rest.
I'll be back soon

15:41.500 --> 15:46.500
You even dropped the dice into the
medicine. You're a hopeless addict

15:46.500 --> 15:49.500
I bet nobody will believe me
if I tell them

15:53.300 --> 15:55.100
I really mustn't gamble anymore

15:56.500 --> 16:00.500
No, I can gamble. Just don't do it
while I'm decocting medicinal herbs

16:00.980 --> 16:02.500
Fool!

16:15.500 --> 16:20.500
What are you doing?!
Let me in! Let me in!

16:21.100 --> 16:23.100
Can't you see they're critically ill?

16:23.100 --> 16:25.900
Take them to the isolation camp!

16:27.500 --> 16:30.500
Let me in! Let go of me!

16:33.500 --> 16:35.500
Shuangxi!

16:40.980 --> 16:42.980
Sir, don't take Shuangxi away

16:42.980 --> 16:47.500
She has indigestion, not the plague.
Don't take her away!

16:47.500 --> 16:49.100
Is that so?

16:49.100 --> 16:53.500
Her sister is not ill either. She was
laughing and joking with me earlier

16:53.500 --> 16:57.500
Fuqi, don't let them take us
to the isolation camp

16:57.500 --> 17:00.500
No one who goes in there
ever comes out alive

17:01.500 --> 17:05.100
I'm scared.
Don't let them take us away!

17:05.500 --> 17:08.500
I won't let them.
You can count on it

17:08.500 --> 17:12.500
I'll send you there too
if you try to stop us!

17:12.500 --> 17:14.500
Take them away!

17:18.500 --> 17:20.500
Let go of me!

17:20.500 --> 17:21.980
Shuangxi!

17:23.500 --> 17:25.500
Let me go, do you hear me!

17:25.500 --> 17:29.500
Shuangxi! Shuangxi!

17:29.980 --> 17:32.500
Let go of me!

17:32.980 --> 17:36.500
I've left that god-forsaken place
behind me at last!

17:37.980 --> 17:40.500
How can you say that?

17:40.500 --> 17:44.500
Ping'an is not some god-forsaken
place. I grew up there

17:44.500 --> 17:48.500
It's where my family and friends live.
It's my home

17:48.980 --> 17:50.980
Sorry, no offence

17:51.500 --> 17:54.500
None taken.
I wonder if I should say this

17:54.500 --> 17:56.060
Go ahead

17:56.500 --> 18:01.500
It's thanks to Fu that we were able
to leave the town safely

18:02.500 --> 18:04.500
Don't be angry with him anymore

18:05.500 --> 18:10.500
He made me crawl into that hole.
I'll never forget that

18:11.500 --> 18:15.500
Fu has been cursed with bad luck
all his life,

18:15.500 --> 18:17.500
unlike what his name suggests

18:18.500 --> 18:21.980
Serves him right for incurring
the wrath of the Jade Emperor

18:21.980 --> 18:23.500
What?

18:24.500 --> 18:26.060
Nothing

18:26.500 --> 18:29.100
I quite pity him, really

18:29.500 --> 18:32.500
He was orphaned at a young age
and didn't have a proper home

18:32.500 --> 18:37.500
He loved hanging around in Fengyue
Tang and learnt a lot of street smarts

18:38.500 --> 18:40.300
Do you look down on him?

18:40.900 --> 18:42.500
You wouldn't understand

18:42.500 --> 18:46.500
You keep your cards close to your chest
and seem to have many secrets

18:48.500 --> 18:53.500
Do you all dislike me? Be honest
with me. I won't be offended

18:53.980 --> 18:59.500
You seem to think you know everything
just because you're highly-skilled

18:59.500 --> 19:03.500
You're interfering and
constantly finding fault with us

19:03.500 --> 19:07.500
No wonder Fu and Lu are always
at loggerheads with you

19:07.500 --> 19:12.500
Such ingratitude! You think I enjoy
being interfering? I don't!

19:12.500 --> 19:14.500
See, you're angry again

19:14.500 --> 19:19.500
I'm sorry for what I said.
I just want all of you to get along

19:19.500 --> 19:24.500
Oh, never mind. You will understand
my good intentions one day

19:24.500 --> 19:27.500
Wait, Miss Ma! Hang on!

19:27.500 --> 19:31.900
We seem to be back
where we were earlier

19:35.500 --> 19:38.980
You're right.
We've been going the wrong way

19:38.980 --> 19:41.500
Are you sure?
It's going to be dark soon

19:41.500 --> 19:43.500
Listen, we're staying put

19:43.500 --> 19:45.500
We are? Why?

19:45.500 --> 19:47.500
First we must calm our minds

19:47.500 --> 19:50.500
I want you to sit down and
meditate so as to...

19:50.500 --> 19:54.500
rid your mind of the three poisons -
wrong desire, hatred and ignorance

19:54.500 --> 19:56.500
Rid my mind of poisons?

19:56.500 --> 20:00.500
We'd better press on while there's
light or we'll be eaten up by wolves

20:00.500 --> 20:02.500
Do you have a plan?

20:03.500 --> 20:07.500
You're smarter and more skilled
in martial arts than me

20:07.500 --> 20:09.500
Then sit here like I said

20:09.500 --> 20:11.100
What for?

20:11.100 --> 20:12.100
Sit!

20:13.500 --> 20:16.100
Don't look at me that way.
I'm terrified

20:47.500 --> 20:49.500
Where there's a will, there's a way

20:49.500 --> 20:53.500
Don't worry about not being able
to find the furnace

20:56.500 --> 20:58.060
I'm not afraid

20:58.500 --> 21:02.980
I'm just worried they won't be able
to hold out until I return

21:04.500 --> 21:06.140
Not to worry

21:06.500 --> 21:11.500
We'll take the mountain path from
here on. It will save us 3 days

21:12.500 --> 21:17.500
But the going will be tough.
It might prove too much for you

21:18.980 --> 21:22.980
No matter how tough the going is,
I won't be daunted

21:24.500 --> 21:27.500
I must get back to them
as quickly as possible

21:30.300 --> 21:33.300
Let's finish our food
so we can be on our way

21:47.500 --> 21:49.100
Hurry up

21:49.500 --> 21:51.060
Faster!

21:59.500 --> 22:01.300
What's that sound?

22:02.500 --> 22:04.500
The wolves are howling!

22:05.500 --> 22:09.300
What's so scary about wolves?
See, you dropped the fruit

22:10.500 --> 22:13.500
I'm not scared.
Who says I am?

22:14.500 --> 22:17.500
Good. We'll spend the night here

22:18.100 --> 22:21.100
I'm going to bed now.
You take the first watch

22:22.500 --> 22:24.500
I take the first watch?

22:24.500 --> 22:27.500
I'll take the second watch.
Is there a problem?

22:30.500 --> 22:35.980
Relax. Wolves are afraid of fire.
Just keep them off with a torch

22:36.100 --> 22:39.500
Really?
I can keep them off with a torch?

22:39.500 --> 22:41.500
Don't let the fire go out

22:43.500 --> 22:45.500
You're sure about the torch?

23:17.500 --> 23:19.100
A torch

23:39.500 --> 23:41.060
So many of them?

23:57.500 --> 23:59.060
So many?

23:59.500 --> 24:02.500
I'm too skinny. You won't like
the taste of my flesh

24:04.500 --> 24:06.500
Miss Ma!

24:08.500 --> 24:10.060
She's gone

24:10.500 --> 24:12.500
Miss Ma!
Where are you?

24:12.980 --> 24:14.980
You're frightening me!

24:18.500 --> 24:21.500
Could she have fallen prey
to the wolves?

24:22.500 --> 24:24.500
I'll kill you,
you horrible creatures!

24:27.100 --> 24:28.980
I'll burn you alive!

24:47.500 --> 24:49.300
What are you doing?

24:49.300 --> 24:51.500
I thought the wolves took you away!

24:52.500 --> 24:57.500
Don't lie. You were nowhere around
when I got up. Where did you go?

24:58.500 --> 25:00.980
I've been here all the time

25:01.500 --> 25:03.500
You're acting so weird

25:08.500 --> 25:10.980
Hateful wolves.
It's all your fault!

25:24.500 --> 25:26.500
Thanks, little wolf

25:27.500 --> 25:31.500
He's quite brave, I must say.
Who on earth is he?

25:31.980 --> 25:34.500
He's no ordinary guy

25:51.980 --> 25:54.500
I thought you found the going
too tough and left

25:54.500 --> 25:57.500
Do I look like a quitter?

25:58.500 --> 26:01.500
I'm not afraid of anything
after last night

26:01.500 --> 26:04.500
Last night?
What happened last night?

26:05.500 --> 26:09.500
Nothing. Nothing happened.
I'll carry on with my exercise

26:32.300 --> 26:34.100
What do you want?

26:34.500 --> 26:38.500
Sir, my master told me to bring you
these carps...

26:38.500 --> 26:41.500
and to congratulate you
on this happy occasion

26:41.500 --> 26:44.980
What happy occasion?
You must have made a mistake

26:44.980 --> 26:48.500
No, I haven't.
He said your wife is pregnant

26:48.500 --> 26:50.980
What wife? I'm not even married

26:51.500 --> 26:54.500
You'll be married soon
once you accept this gift

26:54.980 --> 26:56.900
-Are you sure?
-Yes

26:57.500 --> 26:59.980
-You don't know who I am?
-Who are you?

26:59.980 --> 27:04.500
I'm Wu Fuqi. I bring good luck
to everyone I meet

27:04.980 --> 27:09.500
You have such a sense of humour.
Are you trying to bribe me?

27:10.500 --> 27:12.500
Come on, don't say that

27:12.500 --> 27:17.980
With an epidemic going on, carps as
fresh as these are hard to come by

27:18.500 --> 27:21.500
Give them to your mother
as a special treat

27:21.500 --> 27:23.500
All right. You may go now

27:23.500 --> 27:27.500
Sir, I have a mother too.
She's inside the isolation camp

27:27.500 --> 27:30.500
May I go in to see her?

27:30.980 --> 27:32.980
All right.
Open the gate

27:32.980 --> 27:34.500
Thanks!

28:12.500 --> 28:14.500
Shuangxi...

28:15.980 --> 28:17.820
It's time for your medicine

28:21.500 --> 28:23.220
What are you doing here?

28:23.500 --> 28:25.900
Your medicine is ready.
Don't let it get cold

28:26.980 --> 28:29.900
Fuqi-ge, I'm sorry
to have to trouble you again

28:30.500 --> 28:33.500
There's no need to apologize

28:34.500 --> 28:37.500
You've been so good to me

28:37.500 --> 28:41.500
I'll never be able
to repay your kindness

28:43.900 --> 28:47.500
Don't say that. I'm not expecting
anything in return

28:47.980 --> 28:51.980
You must concentrate on getting well
for your own sake

28:54.500 --> 28:56.500
Look what I've bought you

28:57.500 --> 29:00.500
There's a quilt, charcoal
as well as food

29:00.980 --> 29:05.500
You don't know how hard it is
to get hold of anything these days

29:05.500 --> 29:09.100
Some shops are closed,
some refuse to sell their stuff,

29:09.100 --> 29:11.100
and some demand exorbitant prices

29:11.100 --> 29:15.500
I had to threaten to burn down their
shops and steal their stuff...

29:15.500 --> 29:17.500
before they'd sell me anything

29:17.500 --> 29:19.500
Some even refused my money

29:21.500 --> 29:23.500
I don't want them.
Take them back

29:25.500 --> 29:28.500
Those people went too far

29:29.500 --> 29:32.980
I was only trying
to teach them a lesson

29:33.500 --> 29:35.500
I know you mean well,

29:35.500 --> 29:39.500
but I can't let you commit theft
and arson for me

29:41.500 --> 29:45.500
I won't do it again
if you don't want me to

29:46.500 --> 29:49.500
I'm really worried about you

29:51.500 --> 29:55.500
If we were the only people left
in Ping'an Town,

29:55.500 --> 29:58.980
I would still stick with you
through thick and thin

30:02.500 --> 30:04.500
Where is Shou and Miss Ma?

30:05.500 --> 30:09.500
They've set off for Penglai Island
to look for the furnace

30:09.500 --> 30:11.500
You'll be cured once they find it

30:12.100 --> 30:13.300
Really?

30:14.500 --> 30:18.100
I quite miss them.
Do you?

30:18.980 --> 30:20.500
Of course

30:21.100 --> 30:24.100
But I envy Delu and the Princess

30:25.500 --> 30:28.980
They must be on cloud nine now

30:29.500 --> 30:31.980
How I wish we could be like them

30:32.500 --> 30:34.500
We will

30:38.980 --> 30:42.500
Yes, I believe
we'll be like them one day

30:49.500 --> 30:53.500
Shuangxi,
I'm not blessed with good fortune

30:54.500 --> 30:56.500
I can't pass it on to you

30:59.500 --> 31:05.500
It's just your luck to have met me
instead of Lu or Shou

31:05.980 --> 31:10.500
At least we can
share weal and woe together

31:11.500 --> 31:13.140
Don't let it get cold

31:13.500 --> 31:16.500
-It's very bitter
-Still, you must finish it

31:16.500 --> 31:18.300
Go on

31:21.980 --> 31:26.500
Be a good girl.
Go on, finish it up

31:33.500 --> 31:36.500
I've finished with my visit.
Please let me out

31:36.500 --> 31:38.100
Who let you in?

31:38.100 --> 31:42.100
He did. He's got a mole here.
I remember him

31:42.500 --> 31:44.500
He said you let him in

31:44.500 --> 31:46.980
I did not.
Did anyone see it?

31:47.220 --> 31:51.500
I gave you two carps before
you'd let me in, so don't deny it

31:51.500 --> 31:53.500
They saw it too

31:53.500 --> 31:56.500
When did I accept any carp from you?
Did you see it?

31:56.900 --> 31:58.100
You scoundrel!

31:58.100 --> 31:59.500
Get back inside!

31:59.900 --> 32:01.500
Go on!

32:09.500 --> 32:11.500
Why did you come back?

32:11.500 --> 32:15.500
They wouldn't let me out.
I'll stay and take care of you

32:16.500 --> 32:18.980
They wouldn't let you leave?

32:20.500 --> 32:22.900
But you might get infected

32:22.900 --> 32:25.500
I'll be fine, don't worry

32:26.500 --> 32:30.980
I need to find the three of you
a better place to stay

32:37.500 --> 32:39.100
Lie down

32:52.100 --> 32:54.500
Shuangxi, Daxi!
Come here

32:57.500 --> 33:01.100
You needn't worry about being
exposed to the elements now

33:02.900 --> 33:04.500
Thank you, Fuqi

33:04.500 --> 33:07.500
Not at all.
Go on in

33:56.500 --> 33:58.300
Have another sip

34:05.980 --> 34:08.500
Jiujin, time for your medicine

34:11.500 --> 34:14.500
Wu Fuqi, you look bored

34:15.500 --> 34:20.980
Bored? You don't know how lucky I feel
to be able to look after Shuangxi

34:20.980 --> 34:23.500
Stop kidding yourself.
How about a game?

34:26.500 --> 34:29.100
-What have you in mind?
-Let's play dice

34:29.100 --> 34:30.100
Great!

34:46.500 --> 34:48.500
Is it big or small this time?

34:48.980 --> 34:51.500
This is a boring game.
Let's play something else

34:51.500 --> 34:53.500
OK, let me think about it

34:55.500 --> 34:57.500
I've got it

34:59.300 --> 35:03.100
Th person whose pot boils first
shall be the winner

35:03.100 --> 35:04.500
Well?

35:04.500 --> 35:06.500
That's a great idea

35:09.500 --> 35:11.500
Boil! Boil!

35:17.500 --> 35:19.500
Mine's boiled!

35:21.500 --> 35:24.500
Pay up, pay up

35:29.500 --> 35:31.100
Wu Fuqi!

35:35.500 --> 35:37.060
Shuangxi...

35:37.500 --> 35:40.500
Didn't you swear to quit gambling?

35:41.500 --> 35:45.500
We were playing for peanuts,
not money

35:45.500 --> 35:47.500
You still deny it?

35:47.500 --> 35:52.100
Sis, it's pointless talking to him.
He's incorrigible

35:52.100 --> 35:53.500
Let's go

35:53.500 --> 35:55.500
Shuangxi!

36:06.500 --> 36:08.500
Shuangxi, how do you feel?

36:09.500 --> 36:11.500
I'd like some water

36:11.500 --> 36:13.300
I'll get it for you

36:18.500 --> 36:20.060
Here

36:21.500 --> 36:24.500
What are you doing?
You nearly scared me to death!

36:31.500 --> 36:33.500
Shuangxi, have some water

36:34.500 --> 36:37.100
I won't get up until you forgive me

36:38.980 --> 36:40.500
Just go

36:40.500 --> 36:44.500
You hear that?
She wants you to leave

36:45.500 --> 36:50.500
I'm not leaving. I'll remain on
my knees until you forgive me

36:51.300 --> 36:52.980
You're despicable!

36:53.500 --> 36:58.500
No. I'm here because I really want
to take care of all of you

36:58.500 --> 37:01.500
Those people were ill
and feeling hopeless

37:01.500 --> 37:07.100
I only wanted to cheer them up.
We weren't gambling. Honest!

37:07.500 --> 37:12.500
No? I saw all of you together.
How can you still deny it?

37:12.500 --> 37:15.500
We were playing for peanuts,
not money

37:16.300 --> 37:19.500
I'd vowed not to gamble for money
while decocting herbs for you

37:19.500 --> 37:21.500
And I really kept my word

37:21.500 --> 37:23.500
That's a lame excuse

37:24.500 --> 37:26.980
Shuangxi, please believe me

37:27.500 --> 37:30.500
They all had such fun just now

37:30.500 --> 37:35.980
There were smiles on their faces.
I did them a favour

37:36.500 --> 37:40.500
Do us a favour
by leaving us alone

37:41.500 --> 37:44.100
Daxi, please don't be so angry

37:44.500 --> 37:49.500
You need some form of amusement too
so you can relax

37:49.500 --> 37:51.980
That will speed up your recovery

37:53.500 --> 37:56.500
Don't say another word
to provoke my sister

37:57.500 --> 37:59.500
Just go

37:59.500 --> 38:04.500
Very well,
I'll leave since you want me to

38:04.500 --> 38:08.100
She wants you to quit gambling,
so why don't you?

38:08.500 --> 38:12.500
Gambling is a bad habit I acquired
over twenty eight years

38:12.500 --> 38:15.100
It's hard for me to change overnight

38:15.980 --> 38:17.980
Give me more time

38:17.980 --> 38:21.500
Don't say another word.
Just go

38:24.500 --> 38:26.900
I'll get you some hot water

38:39.500 --> 38:41.500
Let me see how they taste

38:44.500 --> 38:47.500
What have you done to me?
I can't move

38:47.500 --> 38:50.980
I hit one of your acupoints.
You have to name it

38:50.980 --> 38:52.500
What acupoint?

38:52.500 --> 38:55.500
I've taught you about these points
on the human body...

38:55.500 --> 38:58.500
which, when stimulated, can help
to cure certain illnesses

38:58.500 --> 39:00.500
Don't tell me
you've forgotten everything?

39:02.500 --> 39:04.500
Tell me the name of the acupoint

39:04.980 --> 39:07.100
Come on, don't tax my brain

39:07.500 --> 39:10.500
Then you shall stand here.
You won't get any dinner

39:10.500 --> 39:12.500
Don't do this to me

39:13.500 --> 39:15.500
Oh, the berries are delicious

39:16.220 --> 39:17.900
I'm hungry

39:17.900 --> 39:19.500
Oh, I remember now

39:19.500 --> 39:21.500
So what's it called?

39:21.500 --> 39:25.500
The acupoint half a ci above
the ankle is called zhusanli

39:26.500 --> 39:29.500
Zhusanli, when stimulated,
may aid digestion

39:29.500 --> 39:33.500
You're still obsessed with food.
Here's a berry for you

39:35.500 --> 39:37.500
Thanks. Now unblock the point

39:42.980 --> 39:46.500
Just follow that star and we will
soon arrive at the Eastern Sea

39:47.500 --> 39:50.500
I'm surprised you're so knowledgeable

39:51.500 --> 39:54.500
Whoever marries you is a lucky man

39:55.500 --> 39:57.500
You've become such a flatterer

39:57.500 --> 40:00.500
I may have to make you
observe the ten commandments

40:00.500 --> 40:03.500
You really think
I'm slick and insincere?

40:04.500 --> 40:07.500
I can tell at a glance
what kind of man you are

40:07.500 --> 40:12.500
You're Golden Swallow.
You're trained to be observant

40:12.500 --> 40:15.500
I could read people easily
even if I weren't Golden Swallow

40:15.500 --> 40:21.100
Oh, very well. I won't be so free
with my compliments in future

40:22.500 --> 40:25.500
Sit down and let me tell you
more about the stars

40:29.500 --> 40:31.300
What star is that?

40:31.500 --> 40:33.500
That's Vega

40:34.500 --> 40:37.980
Next to it is Altair.
They are always together

40:38.500 --> 40:40.980
Right. What about that one?

40:41.500 --> 40:46.500
That's the Big Dipper.
It's made up of seven stars

40:48.500 --> 40:51.500
-What's that?
-A shooting star. Make a wish!

40:51.500 --> 40:53.060
What wish?

41:12.500 --> 41:14.100
Who's that?!

41:14.500 --> 41:16.500
Why did you do that?

41:17.500 --> 41:21.100
The hare's run off!
There goes our dinner

41:21.100 --> 41:24.500
You just can't control
your desire for food

41:25.300 --> 41:29.500
It's a long journey. Wild berries
alone can't fill my stomach

41:29.500 --> 41:34.300
You've accumulated too much poison
in your body. That's why it's bloated

41:34.500 --> 41:37.500
What do you mean it's bloated?
I look prosperous

41:37.500 --> 41:40.500
Be careful what you eat
or you'll ruin your happy lot

42:04.500 --> 42:06.980
What's the matter?
Just relax

42:13.500 --> 42:18.300
Wait here for me while I attend to
some personal business over there

42:29.500 --> 42:33.500
This is such a pleasant place.
I feel at peace with the world

42:34.500 --> 42:39.500
Come, little bird.
Let's breathe in some fresh air

42:43.500 --> 42:45.500
It's so nice and pure

43:08.500 --> 43:13.500
This is outrageous!
Who's fouled up the air here?!

43:18.300 --> 43:19.980
That was good

43:21.500 --> 43:23.500
It's you,
you wretched Longevity Star!

43:24.500 --> 43:28.500
You made me breathe in
the foul gas you passed out!

43:30.980 --> 43:35.500
I'm going to teach you a lesson!

44:14.500 --> 44:15.500
Shou!
